Peoples
========================
Sopravits		'The True Survivors'			People descended from those resistant to the disparatus, live on Maiord
Prosmerif		'Those living by the sea'		A sea-merchant people living on the western coast of Peridis. Utilize the wealth from trade to survive the dessicator's effects


Locations
========================
Peridis			'The Original Lost Home'		Main continent w/ big-ass hole
Essic			'The Dessicator'				Central continent, ancient tech dries the air around it
Centud			'Southern Center'				Southern most continent, full of religious zealots and decendants of Homcolere fundamentalists
Maiord			'Northern Home'					Home to descendants of the primary survivors of the disparatus. Retain large amounts of Homcolere belief systems
Parissif		'Settled Home'					Western most habitable continent, mostly undeveloped wilderness, home to a wide variety of warring peoples


